# Vesta field-multiply leaf axiom ↔ fiat-crypto theorem index

Citation table connecting the field-multiply denotation axiom in
`CatCrypt/Crypto/Vale/VestaFieldMul.lean` to its discharging fiat-crypto
theorem. Parallel to `CatCrypt/Crypto/KeyAgreement/X25519/CoqAxioms.lean`.

## Field / prime

Vesta base field (Pasta cycle),
`p = 2^254 + 0x224698fc0994a8dd8c46eb2100000001`
= `0x40000000000000000000000000000000224698fc0994a8dd8c46eb2100000001`
= `28948022309329048855892746252171976963363056481941647379679742748393362948097`.
The fiat-crypto `fiat_vesta_mul` is generated by
`word_by_word_montgomery --lang Rust vesta 64 '2^254 + 0x224698fc0994a8dd8c46eb2100000001'`
into `fiat-crypto/fiat-rust/src/vesta_64.rs`; the Rust wrapper is
`vesta-safe-rust/src/lib.rs::fp_mul` (C ABI `vesta_fp_mul`, following the
`pallas-safe-rust/src/ffi.rs` convention). Montgomery radix `R = 2^256`,
4×u64 saturated limbs (32 bytes).

## Status legend

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| ✅ proved | fiat-crypto theorem already exists and is `Qed`-closed |
| 📌 cite-only | citation is the cross-prover trust boundary |

## Field arithmetic (Fp_{Vesta})

`Vesta_fmul_denote` is a `def` (`Number.montgomeryMul` at the Vesta prime and
`vestaNprime256`); its value spec `Vesta_fmul_denote_spec` is discharged in
Lean by `Number.montgomeryMul_correct` — the value core of the owned-x86 Pasta
Montgomery-multiply kernel `PastaBignumTierA.vesta_emit_montmul_runBlock`. The
fiat-crypto theorem below is the cross-prover citation for the linked C symbol.

| Lean leaf | Status | citation |
|---|---|---|
| `Vesta_fmul_denote_spec` | ✅ proved (in Lean) | `Number.montgomeryMul_correct` at `vestaP = valLimbs vestaLimbs` (`vestaP_eq_twin`, `PastaBignumTierA.vestaLimbs_value`); range `< 2·p` and `out · 2^256 ≡ x · y (mod p)`. |
| `Vesta_fmul_denote` (C symbol) | 📌 cite-only | `fiat-crypto/src/Arithmetic/WordByWordMontgomery.v::mulmod_correct` (`Qed`): `eval (from_montgomerymod (mulmod a b)) mod m = (eval (from_montgomerymod a) * eval (from_montgomerymod b)) mod m` for `valid a`, `valid b`, at `m = p_{Vesta}`. C-operation form: `fiat-crypto/src/COperationSpecifications.v` module `WordByWordMontgomery`, `mul_correct`. Realized leaf: `fiat_vesta_mul` in `fiat-crypto/fiat-rust/src/vesta_64.rs`; Montgomery product `x · y · R⁻¹ mod p`, `R = 2^256`. |

